# Fallback task — prompt and settings

The safety net for the relay (activation step 5 in `agents/RELAY.md`). It
fires twice a day and only acts if the relay has stalled.

- **Schedule:** `0 6,18 * * *` (06:00 and 18:00 UTC)
- **Mode:** fresh session per firing
- **Name suggestion:** `{{ project_name }} relay fallback (2x daily)`

## Prompt

> You are the fallback for the autonomous agent relay on
> {{ github_owner }}/{{ project_slug }}. Make sure the repository is checked
> out, fetch and check out branch `{{ integration_branch }}`, read AGENTS.md,
> agents/RELAY.md, agents/CODING_RULES.md and HANDOVER.md, then follow the
> "Fallback session" section of agents/RELAY.md. Apply the budget rule.
